"type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Adds `tasks/connect-a-sensor-cable-holding-the-sensor-while-turning-its-coupling-ring/`: Connect the robot's sensor cable to the new proximity sensor: pull the red protective cap off the sensor's connector and drop it in the blue parts tray; take the cable's connector off its parking holder and push it onto the sensor's connector; the sensor turns in its bracket because its nuts are not tightened yet, so hold the sensor still with one hand while the other turns the connector's knurled coupling ring until it is tight and the sensor's green light comes on. Then let go of both and take both arms back to where they started.\n\n- `connect_a_sensor_cable_holding_the_sensor_while_turning_its_coupling_ring.py`: the `yam_arena` task file (scene, `success()`, `score()` and a scripted `demo()`)\n- `task.json`: media `M-WD7RA3` (Dream-1 run, scripted demo, setup screenshot)\n- `README.md`: commands to run and score a trial, runtime per trial, seeds\n\nScores: Dream-1 run: 0.0; demo: 1.0.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-10T22:30:39Z","updated_at":"2026-11-12T22:59:29Z","closed_at":"2026-11-12T22:59:29Z","merged_at":"2026-11-12T22:59:29Z","merge_commit_sha":"d418612e78d974e20d9f2a30700a3a65b910c901","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Huangruopeng:connect-a-sensor-cable-holding-the-sensor-while-turning-its-coupling-ring","ref":"connect-a-sensor-cable-holding-the-sensor-while-turning-its-coupling-ring","repo":{"id":1446218710,"node_id":"R_kgDOVjOL1g","name":"benchmark-tasks","full_name":"Huangruopeng/benchmark-tasks","owner":{"login":"Huangruopeng","id":41980080,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTgwMDgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41980080?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huangruopeng","html_url":"https://github.com/Huangruopeng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com